    {
      "statement": "同一个整体，平均分成3份的一份比平均分成6份的一份大，所以1/3>1/6。",
      "reason": "The context explicitly states that when comparing unit fractions with the same whole, the fraction with fewer parts is larger, and gives the example 1/3 > 1/6.",
      "attributed": 1
    },
