      "statement": "分母相同的分数相加，分母不变、分子相加，1/5+2/5=3/5。",
      "reason": "The context explains that for same-denominator fractions, the denominator remains unchanged and the numerators are added, and provides examples such as 1/7+3/7=4/7. The specific calculation 1/5+2/5=3/5 follows directly from this rule.",
      "attributed": 1
    }
  ]
}
